+//=======================================================================
+// function : findVanishing034b
+// purpose  : Issue 034 lane B2. Collects the faces whose offset vanishes
+//            (see VanishRecord034b) and the pairs of faces to intersect
+//            around every connected set of them: pairs of surviving
+//            ("rim") faces, and pairs (removed face of a thick solid, rim
+//            face) when the set touches a removed face. Leaves the record
+//            empty when some set is outside the handled scope.
